==English==
{{wikipedia}}

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|ML.|en}} {{m|la|registrārius}}, from {{m|la|registrum||register}} + {{m|la|-ārius||agent}}. See more at {{m|en|register}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|en|/ˈɹɛdʒ.ɪsˌtɹɑɹ/}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# An [[official]] [[keeper]] or [[recorder]] of [[record]]s.
# An [[officer]] in a [[university]] who keeps [[enrollment]] and [[academic]] [[achievement]] records.
# A [[doctor]] receiving [[advanced]] [[specialist]] [[training]] in some [[countries]] in order to become a [[consultant]].
# {{lb|en|Internet}} a [[service]] that [[manage]]s [[domain name]]s.

====Related terms====
* {{l|en|register}}, {{l|en|registry}}

